<%- include('../partials/header') %>
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="bg" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1476514525535-07fb3b4ae5f1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2000&q=80')"></div>
  <div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow" style="color:#f1d7b3">About us</span><h1>Travel planning with a personal touch</h1>
    <p><%= brand.name %> is a boutique travel agency based in <%= brand.city %>, planning vacations for couples, families and groups around the world.</p></div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Our approach</span>
      <h2>We do the research. You get the vacation.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Planning a trip today means comparing dozens of sites, fees and fine print. We believe that should be our job, not yours.</p>
      <p>Every request is handled by a real travel agent. We use modern research tools to compare airline vacation packages, online travel providers and booking flights and hotels separately, then we look at the complete cost, including the fees that usually show up at checkout.</p>
      <p>From there it is personal. We hand pick the options that fit you, explain the tradeoffs in plain language and only book once you have chosen and we have confirmed the final price with you.</p>
    </div>
    <img class="reveal" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1501785888041-af3ef285b470?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1100&q=80" alt="Mountain lake at sunrise" loading="lazy">
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section sand">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head center"><span class="eyebrow">What we stand for</span><h2>Our promises to you</h2></div>
    <div class="grid g4">
      <div class="reveal"><h3>Transparency</h3><p class="muted">Clear totals, clear inclusions and clear policies before you decide.</p></div>
      <div class="reveal"><h3>Your priorities first</h3><p class="muted">The best trip for you is not always the cheapest one. We plan around what you value.</p></div>
      <div class="reveal"><h3>No pressure</h3><p class="muted">Requests and proposals are free. You only move forward when you are ready.</p></div>
      <div class="reveal"><h3>Here when it counts</h3><p class="muted">Questions before you go or help while you are away, you have one person to call.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="cta-band"><div><h2>Ready when you are</h2><p>Tell us about the trip you have in mind.</p></div><a href="/plan" class="btn btn-gold">Plan My Vacation</a></div></div></section>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
